stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> reserved: UUID directory created
  reserved --> rejected: private storage unavailable
  reserved --> started: status.json written
  started --> accepted: cloud ok (ack only)
  started --> executed: local final answer
  executed --> verified: matches expectResponse
  started --> rejected: provider error
  started --> unknown: timeout, cancel, output limit, invalid output
  accepted --> [*]
  executed --> [*]
  verified --> [*]
  rejected --> [*]
  unknown --> [*]
